sequenceDiagram
  participant Start as ArchLucidPersistenceStartup
  participant Mig as DatabaseMigrator
  participant Green as GreenfieldBaselineMigrationRunner
  participant DbUp as DbUp scripts 051 plus
  participant Boot as SqlSchemaBootstrapper
  participant Verify as MigrateVerify
  Start->>Mig: Run System and Tenant
  Mig->>Green: stamp 001 to 050 when greenfield
  Mig->>DbUp: apply embedded Migrations sql
  Mig->>Boot: ArchLucid.sql bootstrap
  Verify->>DbUp: sentinel drift check
